repository-code: 'https://github.com/SECQUOIA/pd_ising'
url: 'https://github.com/SECQUOIA/pd_ising'
abstract: >-
  Process design optimization case studies comparing classical branch-and-bound
  and solution-pool solvers with QUBO/Ising heuristics (simulated annealing,
  D-Wave quantum annealing, and QCi entropy computing) for ionic-liquid
  reactor-separator network design and drug-substance manufacturing flowsheets.
keywords:
  - Process Design
  - QUBO
  - Ising Model
  - Quantum Annealing
  - Simulated Annealing
  - Mixed-Integer Programming
